A note on what these are
------------------------

Every sample in this repository is SYNTHETIC. No sample describes a real site, a real party, a real
contract value, or any data from a real project. The figures are plausible and internally consistent
so that the samples behave like real projects in software — they are not market data and must not be
used to underwrite, price, bid, or design anything real.

No element in this library has been field-verified against a constructed building. See the "Level of
development" section of README.md before citing any LOD claim.
